'''Treat''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by purchasing the Treat Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or the [[Sweet Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Event]].

== Appearance ==
The gun has a dessert theme, with pink icing and sprinkles on the upper part of the gun. There are light pink hearts and light blue stars on the handle and barrel. There is a pink teddy bear head above the handle and pink frosting at the end of the handle.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly knife [[Sweet]], creating the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sweet Set|Sweet Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Treat]].

